WEBVTT

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.518
Disorder afflicts the land,

00:03:01.542 --> 00:03:05.226
caused by powerful and nefarious forces

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.184
working against the interests of humanity.

00:03:08.208 --> 00:03:12.101
But the hero will revolt
against this disorder,

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.268
fight those powerful forces,

00:03:14.292 --> 00:03:17.018
against the odds overthrow them

00:03:17.042 --> 00:03:20.083
and restore harmony to the land.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:22.958
You've heard this story before.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.351
It's the Bible story.

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:27.476
It's the "Harry Potter" story.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.976
It's the "Lord of the Rings" story.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.833
It's the "Narnia" story.